  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_eve04",
      "hash64": "530F6C48C19F48DD",
      "text": "听说学生会长妮莫\\n对宝可梦的招式效果\\r\\n全都了如指掌。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_eve05",
      "hash64": "530F6B48C19F472A",
      "text": "我的帕奇利兹\\n很喜欢高高的地方哦～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_eve07",
      "hash64": "530F6948C19F43C4",
      "text": "我从朋友那里交换来了鬼斯通，\\n于是它就进化成了耿鬼。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_eve08",
      "hash64": "530F6048C19F3479",
      "text": "进化后的宝可梦\\n会变得这么大啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_eve09",
      "hash64": "530F5F48C19F32C6",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_ni01",
      "hash64": "6D85DE7704923977",
      "text": "比起在自己的房间，\\n还是在教室学习更有效率啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_ni02",
      "hash64": "6D85DF7704923B2A",
      "text": "到了晚上，\\n幽灵属性的宝可梦会很多吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_ni03",
      "hash64": "6D85E07704923CDD",
      "text": "即使是同一种宝可梦，\\n太晶属性也会有所不同，真有意思。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_ni04",
      "hash64": "6D85D977049230F8",
      "text": "N/A",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "a_sch_class1a_ni05",
      "hash64": "6D85DA77049232AB",
      "text": "这只宝宝丁\\n是我通过魔法交换遇到的！\\c\\n谢谢你，\\n在世界某地的某人。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
